		{"id":"future-ideas","type":"text","text":"# FUTURE IDEAS","x":1440,"y":210,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# COMMAND CENTER\n\nPersonal development board. GitHub and the authoritative project documents remain the source of truth.","x":360,"y":-60,"width":1020,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"workspace","type":"text","text":"# Project Workspace\n\nReconcile Dashboard/Workspace requirements before defining the Workspace specification.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)\n\n[Near-Term Roadmap](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Near-Term%20Roadmap%202026-10-02.md)","x":1080,"y":320,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"future-architecture","type":"text","text":"# Tool Ecosystem & Host Independence\n\nEvolve CC toward an independent project operating environment with a configurable tool ecosystem. Reduce dependence on Obsidian as host while retaining its capabilities through supported integrations.\n\nUsers configure tools globally and per project, including third-party apps, AI providers, and native CC extensions.\n\n**Status:** Future consideration — not an approved specification or implementation commitment.","x":1440,"y":320,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"start-here","type":"text","text":"# Start Here — SESSION_START\n\n[Open SESSION_START.md](SESSION_START.md)\n\nRead this before any implementation, review, or modification session.","x":0,"y":320,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"done-foundation","type":"text","text":"# Foundation & Data\n\n**WP10 · WP11**\n\nImplementation foundation and Project Record data layer.\n\n[WP10 Specification (final)](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP10%20Implementation%20Foundation%20Specification%20%28final%29.md)\n\n[Master Implementation Index (WP11)](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":360,"y":360,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-gateway","type":"text","text":"# Gateway & Provider\n\n**WP13 · WP14**\n\nGateway root navigation and the Obsidian ProjectRecord provider are implemented and verified.\n\n[Gateway Implementation Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_Gateway%20Implementation%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP13 Project List Screen Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP13%20Phase%203%20Project%20List%20Screen%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP14 ProjectRecordProvider Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP14%20Obsidian%20ProjectRecordProvider%20Specification.md)","x":360,"y":640,"width":300,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-dashboard","type":"text","text":"# Dashboard Core\n\n**WP15 · WP16**\n\nResolution handling and Dashboard core content implemented. WP16 closure decisions remain open.\n\n[WP15 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP15%20Dashboard%20Implementation%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP16 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP16%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification.md)","x":360,"y":1000,"width":300,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"master-index","type":"text","text":"# Master Implementation Index\n\n[Open Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)\n\nUse this index to navigate implementation work packages and their references.","x":0,"y":500,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"file-index","type":"text","text":"# Repository File Index\n\n[Open Repository File Index](docs/indexes/CC_Repository%20File%20Index.md)\n\nUse this index to locate repository files and documentation.","x":0,"y":700,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"wp12","type":"text","text":"# WP12 — Up Button Verification\n\n**Status:** Pending verification\n\nVerify the `goUp()` success path. Current framework verification cannot exercise it because no controller action sets `depth` to `workspace`.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve the verification gap and determine whether an implementation change is needed.\n\n[WP12 Implementation Notes](docs/implementation/CC_Phase%204_WP12%20Implementation%20Notes.md)\n\n[Slice 9B Verification Protocol](docs/verification/WP12%20Step%205%20-%20Slice%209B%20Framework%20Verification%20Protocol.md)","x":720,"y":320,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"wp16","type":"text","text":"# WP16 — Dashboard Decisions\n\n**Status:** Pending architectural rulings\n\n- **Blockers display:** Reconcile WP16 D2 with UI Architecture Specification §6.\n- **Staleness:** Decide how stale Dashboard information is identified and presented.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve both rulings and update the authoritative documentation.\n\n[WP16 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP16%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification.md)\n\n[UI Architecture Specification](docs/architecture/CC_UI%20Architecture%20Specification%20v1.0.md)","x":720,"y":610,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"later","type":"text","text":"# Remaining Work\n\n- Dashboard Attention and Workspace navigation\n- Dashboard-to-Workspace action\n- Staleness and AI Progress Estimate derivation\n- New Project creation and persistence\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":1080,"y":610,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"matrix","type":"text","text":"# Phase 4 Matrix\n\n[Open matrix folder](docs/architecture/phase-4-matrix/)","x":0,"y":920,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"acp-decisions","type":"text","text":"# Architecture Decisions (ACPs)\n\n- [ACP-009 ProjectStatus enum](docs/architecture/ACP-009_ProjectStatus_Enum_Reconciliation.md)\n- [ACP-010 Retire category paging](docs/architecture/ACP-010_Retire_Category_Level_Sibling_Paging_After_Gateway.md)\n- [ACP-011 Gateway mapping](docs/architecture/ACP-011%20%E2%80%94%20Gateway%20Destination-to-View%20Mapping%20and%20Category%20Screen%20Retirement%20Boundary.md)\n- [ACP-012 Root depth: Gateway](docs/architecture/ACP-012%20%E2%80%94%20Rename%20Root%20Navigation%20Depth%20from%20Category%20to%20Gateway.md)\n- [ACP-013 New Project lifecycle](docs/architecture/ACP-013%20%E2%80%94%20New%20Project%20Representation%20and%20Navigation%20Lifecycle.md)\n- [ACP-014 Purpose and Description](docs/architecture/ACP-014%20%E2%80%94%20Purpose%20and%20Description%20Metadata%20Representation.md)\n- [ACP-015 AI Progress Estimate](docs/architecture/ACP-015%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20Progress%20Estimate%20-%20Architectural%20Reconciliation.md)\n- [ACP-016 Dashboard resolution](docs/architecture/ACP-016%20%E2%80%94%20Dashboard%20ProjectRecord%20Resolution%20%28Missing,%20Invalid,%20Duplicate%29.md)\n\n[ACP-008 ProjectStatus reconciliation](CC_Working_Notes/ACP-008_Proposal_Status_Enum_Reconciliation.md) (file is in CC_Working_Notes)\n\nACP-001 to ACP-007 are in the [Phase 3 Architecture Record](docs/architecture/CC_Phase%203%20Architecture%20Record.md).","x":0,"y":1160,"width":300,"height":420,"color":"1"}
	],
